                                  │                                                              │
                                  │↑ 27 above                                                    │
                                  │↑ ↓        scroll it — nothing has been touched yet           │
                                  │w          widen to the referential closure and re-plan       │
                                  │enter      apply it                                           │
                                  │esc        back to the form                                   │
                                  │                                                              │
                                  │What a snapshot row means                                     │
                                  │6db        the databases it covers — a snapshot is one run of…│
                                  │↓          not on this machine; applying downloads it first   │
                                  │✗          a database of it did not finish; it cannot be appl…│
                                  │where      the Manifest tab names every place it is           │
                                  │                                                              │
                                  │The two snapshot panels                                       │
                                  │[3]        Snapshots — what was taken FROM this connection    │
                                  │[4]        Restorable — what can be put ON it, by source      │
                                  │a          apply the selected one; the form names the target  │
                                  │                                                              │
                                  │What a connection row means                                   │
                                  │●          reachable                                          │
                                  │○          not reached yet — pgctl has not tried              │
                                  │⠋          being reached now                                  │
                                  │✗          unreachable — Overview has the error               │
                                  │protected  never an apply target, no override                 │
                                  │guarded    an apply needs the name typed in full              │
                                  │                                                              │
                                  │What a set row means                                          │
                                  │4 closed   closed: it can be applied on its own               │
                                  │4+2        4 named, 2 dragged in by foreign keys              │
                                  │?          not resolved yet — select it to read the catalog   │
                                  │                                                              │
                                  │While something runs                                          │
                                  │tab        the steps, then the log it came from               │
